TITLE:: MERegister
summary:: Symbol and alias register class.
categories:: MusicEngine Library
related:: Classes/MENoteRange, Classes/MERange, Classes/MENote, Reference/RangeSymbols

DESCRIPTION::
MERegister uses the class LINK::Classes/Archive:: to allow the user to save custom aliases and symbols to file, permanently registering them across sessions.


CLASSMETHODS::

PRIVATE:: test, initClass, dictName


METHOD:: newEntry
Creates a new entry in the MERegister dictionary. The symbol EMPHASIS::alias:: gets registered as a key to the string EMPHASIS::symbol::. If the EMPHASIS::alias:: already exists, the method posts a warning and does not overwrite.

NOTE::
LIST::
## EMPHASIS::alias:: should be of type Symbol.
## EMPHASIS::symbol:: should be of type String.
## The EMPHASIS::symbol:: should not include a root note (e.g.: EMPHASIS::"M3P5"::, and NOT EMPHASIS::"CM3P5"::).
## EMPHASIS::alias:: can take any name, provided it's not in use by the MEAlias dictionary, it's not an interval symbol (e.g.: EMPHASIS::P1::, EMPHASIS::m3::, EMPHASIS::P5::, EMPHASIS::M9::, etc.) and does not start with a lowercase EMPHASIS::'b':: (to avoid confusion with flat signs).
## For more information see page LINK::Reference/RangeSymbols::.
::
::

CODE::
MERegister.newEntry('Barbara', "M3d5M6");
r = MENoteRange.new("F#Barbara");

// We can check if an entry has been made by running:
Archive.global[\MERegister][\Barbara]; // M3d5M6

// Get the symbol
MERegister.getSymbolFromAlias('Barbara'); // M3d5M6

// Clear example alias
MERegister.removeEntry('Barbara');
Archive.global[\MERegister][\Barbara]; // nil
::


METHOD:: changeEntry
Allows the user to change the EMPHASIS::symbol:: associated with an EMPHASIS::alias::. If the EMPHASIS::alias:: does not exist the method posts a warning, otherwise it posts a message confirming the change.

CODE::
MERegister.newEntry('Barbara', "M3d5M6");
r = MENoteRange.new("F#Barbara");

MERegister.getSymbolFromAlias('Barbara'); // M3d5M6
MERegister.changeEntry('Barbara', "m3P5M6");
MERegister.getSymbolFromAlias('Barbara'); // m3P5M6

// Clear example alias
MERegister.removeEntry('Barbara');
::


METHOD:: removeEntry
Allows the user to remove an entry by specifying its EMPHASIS::alias::. If the EMPHASIS::alias:: does not exist the method posts a warning, otherwise it posts a message confirming the removal.

CODE::
MERegister.newEntry('Barbara', "M3d5M6");
r = MENoteRange.new("F#Barbara");

MERegister.getSymbolFromAlias('Barbara'); // M3d5M6
MERegister.removeEntry('Barbara');
MERegister.getSymbolFromAlias('Barbara'); // nil
::


METHOD:: getSymbolFromAlias
Returns the EMPHASIS::symbol:: associated to an EMPHASIS::alias::. If the EMPHASIS::alias:: does not exist CODE::nil:: is returned.

CODE::
MERegister.newEntry('Barbara', "M3d5M6");
r = MENoteRange.new("F#Barbara");

MERegister.getSymbolFromAlias('Barbara'); // M3d5M6
// Clear example alias
MERegister.removeEntry('Barbara');
::


METHOD:: showEntries
Lists all entries stored in the MERegister dictionary. If no entries exist the method posts warning.

CODE::
MERegister.newEntry('Barbara', "M3d5M6");
MERegister.newEntry('Veronica', "m3P5M6");
MERegister.newEntry('David', "A3d5m6");

MERegister.showEntries;

// Clear example aliases
MERegister.removeEntry('Barbara');
MERegister.removeEntry('Veronica');
MERegister.removeEntry('David');
::


METHOD:: clearDict
Removes all entries from MERegister dictionary and posts a confirmation message.

CODE::
MERegister.newEntry('Barbara', "M3d5M6");
MERegister.newEntry('Veronica', "m3P5M6");
MERegister.newEntry('David', "A3d5m6");

MERegister.showEntries;

// Clear example aliases
MERegister.clearDict;
::
